    "result_text": "The full suite passes \u2014 `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class, and the build is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nWhen an owner is created (and read back), the response now includes a `displayName` formatted exactly as `LastName, FirstName` from the stored names.\n\nChanges:\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `displayName` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` exposes it.\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` with a computed expression (`owner.getLastName() + \", \" + owner.getFirstName()`) so `toOwnerDto` populates `displayName` from the stored first/last names.\n\nThe DTO is code-generated from the OpenAPI spec at build time, so no hand-written DTO change was needed. `mvn test` reports `BUILD SUCCESS` with the acceptance test green.",
